      "mergeID": "5b97693773d28349cce54484",
      "mergedPostDetails": "So in the latest update to vrchat the video sync component broke for Youtube. A lot of the club maps have been effected and don't play music or only play select songs. It is very frustrating when you spend a lot of time on a world and the main part of your world is now broken. To my knowledge this does not effect streams. I don't know the fix for this and that is partly why I am here, because it was and has worked up until VRChat 2018.3.1\n\n*edit\nApparently YouTube changed something that messed up videos playing.  I am not sure if Vrchat could fix this in anyway now knowing this.  But I will leave this up here for open disscussion on this topic.\n\nAny help with fixing this would be great. Thank you",
      "mergedPostTitle": "VRC Video Sync YT Broken",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5b93021341310017f42a9ad6",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
